        "text_4bYC6X": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Our tea light candles bring elegance to any setup. From dinners to large-scale receptions, these compact candles offer dependable lighting that elevates the atmosphere without stealing the spotlight.</p><p>Tealights are the go-to choice for venues, caterers, and anyone who wants to add visual warmth to any space. Our collection focuses on tealight candles that burn clean and consistently. You’ll find options across multiple burn times—from 3.5 hours to 9 hours—so you can match the candle to the occasion’s pace. Most of our tea light candles are unscented; however, if you are looking for scented options, we offer them as well.</p><p>Each tea candle comes in a durable aluminum cup that holds its shape as the wax burns down. They're easy to set up in glass holders, lanterns, or trays. Hosting a wedding, banquet, or outdoor dinner? Our tealights are reliable, mess-free, and look good in any lighting arrangement.<br/><br/></p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-75"
          }
